#: templates/about_oysyn.html:17
msgid "What is OySyn, and what is it for"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:18
msgid ""
"The first Kazakhstani plagiarism checking system. OySyn is a modern "
"plagiarism detection system designed to check texts for originality. The "
"primary goal of OySyn is to prevent copyright violations and improve the "
"quality of works and scientific research."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:19
msgid ""
"The system has successfully completed the Scalerator 2.0 acceleration "
"program, aimed at supporting startups with export potential, and is a member "
"of Astana HUB."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:21
msgid "What makes OySyn unique compared to other plagiarism detection systems"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:23
msgid ""
"Local data storage: All databases are hosted within the Republic of "
"Kazakhstan, ensuring confidentiality."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:24
msgid ""
"Resource efficiency: Optimized architecture reduces disk space requirements."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:25
msgid ""
"High processing speed: Modern big data processing methods ensure quick text "
"checks."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:26
msgid ""
"Simple interface: The system is intuitive and does not require special "
"technical knowledge."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:27
msgid ""
"Flexibility: OySyn can be customized to meet individual client requirements."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:30
msgid "Who can use OySyn"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:31
msgid "OySyn is designed for various user categories:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:33
msgid ""
"Educational institutions: Checking theses, coursework, and other student "
"works."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:34
msgid ""
"Journalists and publishers: Verifying the originality of materials for "
"publication."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:35
msgid ""
"Content creators: Copywriters, bloggers, and marketers check texts before "
"publication."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:36
msgid "Main focus: Students, postgraduates, doctoral candidates, and faculty."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:39
msgid ""
"Does OySyn offer flexible pricing, and are there limits on the text volume"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:40
msgid ""
"OySyn provides a flexible pricing system suitable for various user "
"categories. For legal entities, individual tariffs can be developed. "
"Detailed information is available on our official website: OySyn."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:42
msgid ""
"Do I need to install software to use OySyn, and does it have a mobile version"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:43
msgid ""
"OySyn is a cloud platform that does not require software installation. To "
"use it:"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:45
msgid "Access the website from any device."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:46
msgid "Register an account."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:47
msgid "Upload text for analysis."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:49
msgid ""
"The system is fully optimized for mobile devices and tablets, ensuring "
"convenience on the go."
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:51
msgid "What are OySyn's development prospects"
msgstr ""

#: templates/about_oysyn.html:52
